<p>50% chance that damage the caster takes will be warped to a set target.</p><p>Once the maximum damage (<acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>spellpower 10, 25, 50, 75, 100,<br>paradox 300">26, 83, 161, 230, 293</acronym>) is absorbed, the time runs out, or the target dies, the shield will crumble.</p>